{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_st03",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_st03",
  "title": "再弈",
  "storyCode": "IW-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "511b4d3d9958ed5c234617723425e103a55c228fbd683f1986e4887f9389c76a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "07下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "罗德岛之后有什么打算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "啊......欸......嗯？我有做过自我介绍吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "你又是什么打算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我总算了了这桩事，当然是回去问那个高高挂起的梁大人......好好算算账。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "也许他说得对，你和我们的缘分，还不止于此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "惊蛰小姐是怎么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "......偶然从师兄弟口中得知灰齐山的事情，立刻赶到了尚蜀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "虽然来迟一步，但不算为时已晚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "令小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我有一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你们这样的存在，是怎么分辨......呃，长幼的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......长幼之分啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "在一片混沌鸿蒙之中，谁最先找到那个答案，谁就能先立于人间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "什么答案？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "一个简单到不行的问题......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......“我是谁”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......太合先生，左乐先生。幸会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "宁小姐，幸会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "见过宁侍郎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "尚蜀之行，未能礼待，失了礼数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "不请自来，多有打扰，冒犯在先。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "左公子是承父命而来，代表司岁台处理酒盏与灰齐山两案，雷厉风行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "宁小姐慧眼如炬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "而梁先生举动，旨在破局，更是令人钦佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......若非司岁台激进，梁大人想必不至于如此举动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人问心无愧，想必肃政院得知此事后，自有公道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "我已草拟奏呈，大可开诚布公，绝无偏颇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......如太合先生所说，“取忠舍义”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "可司岁台此次越俎代庖，无论太傅如何定夺，我都会如实禀告尚书大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "本就该如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "左乐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "在......在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "依你推演，若三人岁相流窜人间，为害尚蜀，以当时局势，你需要多久镇压局面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "又若是岁兽苏醒，大炎备以一城迎战，代价如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......前者需三日工夫，后者恐两败俱伤，巨兽死，而军队十不存三。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "梁洵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "若是今日判你身死，以保礼部与司岁台平安，你如何做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "理当服法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "那如果你今日作为，阴差阳错，导致尚蜀城市受损，百姓蒙受损害，你如何做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "苟求生路，亡兽补牢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "棋局至此，五五之间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "梁洵挑选的那个龙门人，本是一记出奇无理手，却被他抓住了什么蛛丝马迹，棋差一筹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "事已至此，又有多少事在他算计之中？又有多少他没算到的事情，终归还是有利于他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......太傅果然知晓此事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "梁洵，替你知府职位之人，一月内抵达尚蜀。做好交接，随我离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人......不知太傅用意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "随我入京。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......谢过太傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可梁某人还是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "——宁辞秋祝贺梁大人高升。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......宁侍郎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "玉门已从既定航线归国。昨日与龙门接触，准备补给。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "玉门城......是躲避天灾？还是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "另有用途。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "你先一步前往玉门。我与梁洵在京城事了，自会前往。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......！明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "太合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "诸事顺遂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......太合叔，原来早就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "“取忠舍义”，公子莫怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "司岁台此次失误，先不予追究。眼下，确定那一百八十一枚黑子落向何处，才是关键。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "太傅何日离开尚蜀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "明晚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......这么着急，不需要等待信使队伍护送......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "不必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "白天师有意为太傅送行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "还是不必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "尚蜀山道多险，太傅孑然一身，恐有危险......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "怎么，难道尚蜀境内，还敢有贼人作犯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......不。只是，您年事已高，独自出门在外，还是要小心一些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "大炎疆土之内普天之下，我只怕百姓不得安生国业不够昌盛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "我还怕什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "还有什么值得我怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "事已了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "有惊无险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "惊的人不是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "险的是所有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你托我从龙门运盏回尚蜀，一开始就是接了司岁台的密令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可碍于身份，更碍于你身边的某个人，你不得不扣我一顶贼人的帽子，再让镖局来演一出戏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "——可你没和我串通这出戏，就说明，你根本没想演好这出戏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你知道我从来是不喜欢演戏的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "那就是你自己有这个想法了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可司岁台秉烛人就在尚蜀，他们一定不会轻言放弃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你压根就不想让这件事发生在尚蜀，更不想让司岁台一时僭越的行为，扯破了他们与礼部的脸皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可这样，你等于把自己也置于不义之地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "于是有个人，可能是个爱管闲事的人，可能是个心疼你的人，他派了一个赏金猎人来，来抢盏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "盏不在你手上，就让你不必难做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你知道那个人是谁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我也许知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可谁都没料到，横空杀出来个尚冢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "最后事与愿违，所有人都被卷进了这座取江峰，这片忘水坪，你干得实在是不聪明，实在是不聪明......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可对你来说，对你梁洵来说，又似乎太聪明了点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......所以我委托的是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "一个既能察觉到我在想什么，又绝对不会背叛朋友的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我该谢谢你还把我当朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "所以我帮忙帮到底，其实最后找的不是那酒盏主人是谁的答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你找的是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我找的是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你还是不是当初那个立下宏愿的你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你变聪明了，梁洵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不过还好。你还是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......槐天裴的下落，我有些眉目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你一早就有眉目的，只是不想让我分心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你怪我不告诉你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我是怕你还需要帮忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "最近大炎江湖上有一些传言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "武林传言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "既是武林，那一定是少不了他的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "嗯，尚蜀是个好地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "今年梅花开得迟，我还当是为什么，原来是太傅私访尚蜀，稀客稀客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "你何时算主了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "真要细究起来，我还真能算这些山头的半个主人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......大考之处，不在人。在你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "当那一天到来的时候，你们站在哪一方，看着哪一面，心向哪一处，都会直接决定战争的损失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "大炎很难败的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......你确实可以替大炎军旅说这句话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "你与那位宗师各自戍北百年，功不可没。若非如此，朝廷也不会这么念旧情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "司岁台之举虽有越俎代庖之嫌，可无论如何，是深得人心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......峥嵘岁月，流连忘返。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "时至今日，偶尔醉到情深处，仍听得见得，吹角连营。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "朝廷想和你做个买卖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "真难得，我还以为要被下死命令了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "千年以来，天机阁都不曾停歇过一刻。无数军士天师战死塞北，可道高一尺魔高一丈，邪祟诡魔，杀之不绝，始终不能一劳永逸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "最精锐的士卒，最伟大的将领，最睿智的天师，都奔赴塞北，年复一年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......朝廷要你在天机阁外，设十二楼五城。机关三千座，兵俑百万台。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "这件事不需要你立刻去做。也不光你一个人做，大炎已经开始布置，绘制图纸一事，也交由各大天师府解决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "我希望你出手相助，至少能从那座阁楼里换回一个人来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "一个绝不会倒下，但也万万不能倒下的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......不是吧。我可是从惊蛰那里听说过一些传闻，她的祖师爷是个超级麻烦的人......虽然她也没见过就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "哼......依赖源石而扭曲的长生特例，这些人类实在是不讨喜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "不是因为她找过你麻烦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "啊......我记得她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "她还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......还好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "她戍北至今已有三百七十余年。若是她得以脱身回国，朝廷倒也乐意从此放她清闲，让她安享晚年......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "可老前辈总说自己闲不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "听上去是个大工程，那我能得到什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "你想做的事情，朝廷帮你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "杀红眼的野兽，是不能一直拴在笼子里的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "哈，听上去都是对你们好的事情嘛，咱们大炎人就是会谈买卖......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "言已至此，你自己考量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "我也有一事委托太傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......请说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "如今他是否......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "他的行为超过了所有巨兽学士的预计，以自己血肉之身化为一百八十一枚黑子......落于人间......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "他这是要以天地设局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "收官之日，他一定会再度现出真身，那会你亲自问他就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "这一局，务必要赢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......输不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......你们都听到啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "纵横十九道，他会输给这个太傅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "当然输不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "那太傅如何赢的他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "太傅没和他对弈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "黑白千万纵横十九，固然深有其意，可太傅说，他在棋盘上，看不见人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "所以太傅陪他下了另一局棋。以大炎疆土为盘，以天下苍生为子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......谁赢了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "那一次是太傅赢了。所以他甘愿被大炎束缚囚禁，他每输一盘，便自囚一甲子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "嘿，那大炎若是一直有奇才赢他，他岂不是终生走不出京城半步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "谁又知道呢，他其实是一个很不会下棋的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "他学棋很慢，几百年前，他一甲子内，能输上几百几千盘。后来一甲子内，他少输了一些，再过一甲子，不过输百盘左右。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "如此一来，直到某个时候，再无人赢得了他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "于是那一甲子，他便离开了京城......就有了那场事端。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "三姐就是那时......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "我们都能感受得到，这不是什么愉快的感受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "所以太傅赢了那家伙，他才灰溜溜地回到京城，按誓受罚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "也许他很久没有满盘皆输过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "又或者......他已经不止在关注大炎而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......你就是宁辞秋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "那你就是那位胆子大到敢抢天师府行队的赏金猎人了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "我、我那时候又不知道他们是好人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "那个姓白的老头子，他在哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......我带你去见他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "这次的事情，我也该谢谢你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "没什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "不过我还是没明白，不就一只酒杯嘛，既然你知道它在哪儿，你自己偷偷拿走了不就行了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "他是不愿意给我的，所以我确实不能拿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "所以要我帮忙？为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......为什么呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "只是不希望，他卷入这么多麻烦事里，还毫无自觉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......果然这位赏金猎人，是宁侍郎的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "不必警惕，他们不是敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "本来就是司岁台仓促行事，不会追问这位小姐。呃......当然，前提是她进入炎国境内是用的合法手段......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你去找白天师吧，夜半。他就在说好的地方等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......好。你保重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "宁侍郎早就看穿了司岁台与梁大人的谋划。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "不算太早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "可你们好像没看穿梁大人从中斡旋的盘算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......也许他只是对于背叛宁小姐，心有疑虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "无论如何，此事确实是司岁台僭越，事后司岁台自会给礼部一个答复。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......无妨了。都是为大炎谋事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "天气凉，几位也早些休息。我还是去看看夜半那孩子，她初次来大炎，我不放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "宁小姐走好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "保重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "但愿这些儿女情长......不要影响接下来的大事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子年少，说这种话，难免有些故作老成的嫌疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "既为秉烛人，便与这些事情无缘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "斗胆一提，公子先前途经村落，出手擒匪，曾——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "咳、咳——我相信那时的女子只是心怀恩情！怎可与男女之情混为一谈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "若有了救命之恩，这情感便不纯粹了，更有乘人之危的嫌疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "是太合叔误会了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子正论。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "鲤先生不回龙门？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不回。我还要找个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "顺路不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我反正要和这个家伙去一趟办事处，然后再回到罗德岛本舰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "似乎还是顺路的。只不过这一次，我不好再麻烦罗德岛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "鲤先生不用客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "真的是私事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "那位代号乌有的干员兄弟，被卷入这桩麻烦事，白白伤了腿，现在还在医院里，我总不好再给各位添麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "text": "克、克洛丝小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "啊，是桑葚小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "你已经来尚蜀了，说明炎熔已经抵达办事处挺久的了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "text": "是、是的......而且炎熔小姐还让我带信说，你们最好快些去办事处，好像有别的事情发生了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "啊哈哈......这趟炎国之旅还真不消停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "常有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "以前也只在龙门之类的......对了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "之前我就想问了，鲤先生说，梁大人和龙门魏彦吾很像，像在哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我说过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "说过的。相处下来之后，我是觉得一点都不像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "毕竟......都被心上人吃得死死的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "你回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "一百八十一件，你会先岁一步失去理智的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "这些年来，你都在这里，醉生梦死？不......岁月于你没有意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "行裕镖局的一出闹剧，是你一手策划好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "不完全是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "他们和我没有干系才是......为什么要把他们卷进来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "只是一个提醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "提醒我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "你在此梦知天下事，便知乾坤大，犹怜草木青。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "从江南到塞北，再回到这高山云顶，你变了很多。我很不安，妹妹，所以我来提醒你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "提醒你，人心，并没有道德家们鼓吹的那般纯粹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "同门相残，兄弟反目，爱恨情仇皆为棋路。\n你不怕，你现在当然不怕，可你迟早会怕。年会怕，夕会怕，他们变得都太像人了，那他们都会怕。\n只是这样一个......小小的提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "你生气了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "杯中只应有酒，酒不该如此多舌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刹那间，万物停摆。\n尚蜀三山十七峰，如今多出一峰，更有数不清的树，数不清的杈，数不清的叶。\n有风，叶却不动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尚蜀曾有一场天灾。\n肆虐的风暴夹杂着火花，碎裂的源石晶簇如火雨落下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "——尚蜀——曾有天灾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "有人——以酒敬天，黑云退，百姓安！而今，你却将手中盏掷向阴云！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只黑色的酒盏。一枚黑子。\n在这片大地上最恐怖的灾难面前，转瞬间灰飞烟灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "你感到愤怒吗？你悲悯吗？你嫉妒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杯中的声音",
      "text": "铭记这种情绪——大势将起——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......大势将起......我不可能置身事外......对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "呼——哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "text": "......先买酒去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我会离开尚蜀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "我不拦你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "如果两个人想杀了对方，这不是一件多复杂的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "可如果两个人都想被对方杀死......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那我们该省省力气，不然矫情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "我打算退了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "杜遥夜还没做好准备。而且那丫头，这不是一股子想自立门户的想法吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "要是这样，就关门吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你不同意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我不是镖局的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "郑清钺，我们的事情只是暂缓片刻，不是就此握手言和。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "镖局的规矩，上了酒桌不许谈恩怨，反正我就在尚蜀等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "最后一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "听说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹！尚师傅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "怎么了，冒冒失失的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我决定了！我和那些年轻人都谈好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我们去玉门！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
